#category: restaurant
#source: restaurant published nutrition, converted to per-100 g
#verified: 0
#servings: 1 item (100 g)@100*;100 g@100
# IMPORTANT — HOW TO READ THIS FILE
# Restaurants publish per-ITEM nutrition, not per-100 g. Every row here was
# derived by dividing the published panel by the published item weight, so the
# per-100 g figures inherit any error in that weight. ALWAYS log these using the
# named item serving (the default), never by typing grams.
# The whole category is verified:false: it was reconstructed from the author's
# knowledge of published panels without live verification, and chains reformulate.
# id|name|aliases|kcal|protein|carbs|fat|fiber|sugar|satfat|sodium|servings|extra

